LOCUS       sequence-331247-       10183 bp    DNA     circular SYN 15-DEC-2025
DEFINITION  Expresses S. pyogenes CRISPR chimeric RNA element with customizable 
            sgRNA from U6 promoter and puromycin resistance from EF-1a promoter.
            3rd generation lentiviral backbone..
